  "B": "Needs: preliminary-geometry CBEs from H2-1..H2-6 for every row, m_Xe_total from the Xe ledger, a selected tank and MEOP, compressor and intake designs (DI-1.1 / DI-1.2 / DI-1.4), owner decisions OD-M1..OD-M7 (mass BOM), and the RF module mass if Phase-1 outcome B.",
  "C": "Needs: PDR design masses (measured where possible; H-1 / C-1 as-built masses as the first measured points), structure from the spacecraft configuration and launch loads, designed harness, integrated thermal hardware, a layout with positions (CG, alignment) and the integrated mass / power / thermal / life closure."
