 "consumption_contract": {
  "statement": "The builder re-reads every parallel-lane directory at build time (lazily; nothing is imported). From every *.json file directly in a lane directory it collects the list 'interface_demands'. A demand is ADOPTED into this mass model only if all hold: (1) its 'to' names H2-7 (one of h2_7_aliases, or a string containing 'H2-7'); (2) it names an existing line item in 'h2_7_line_item' (e.g. 'R09.m_hall_head_incl_mc'); (3) 'units' is 'kg'; (4) it carries a numeric 'value' or a numeric two-element 'range' [lo, hi] with 0 <= lo <= hi; (5) its 'status' does not start with 'PENDING' or 'TBD'; (6) it carries an 'evidence_class' from the six classes of docs/EVIDENCE.md and a 'basis'. An adopted demand replaces that line item's CBE (basis 'preliminary geometry from <lane>', status PRELIMINARY); the previous analog range is kept as 'superseded_analog'. Every other demand addressed to H2-7 is listed as unadopted for the integration pass. When no lane output exists the rows keep their PENDING status.",
  "aliases_source": "h2_7_aliases"
 },
